  "backdrop": {
    "$type": "color",
    "$description": "Dialog/overlay scrim. FIRST demand-driven extension beyond shadcn's set (docs/process/TOKEN-PIPELINE.md): shadcn hard-codes bg-black/50 with no token behind it, so there was nothing to bind Figma's overlay to. Named `backdrop` per the rule to reuse the old DS's name for a distinction it already made (../design-system/src/tokens.ts).",
